    "template": "Analyze one visible MOC as a bounded dependency-aware reading path. It preserves authored Obsidian link order, resolves entries and prerequisites by visible path/title/alias/preferred term/stable ID/relative path, expands nested MOCs to a limited depth, and returns a separate stable recommended order plus unresolved, ambiguous, external, late-prerequisite, and cycle findings. Selected ATX/Setext-heading and terminal-block locators are checked outside Properties and matching fences (one 8 MiB validation read per target); unresolved locators make navigationComplete=false and block learning checkpoints until repaired. Progress remains note-granular. It never guesses an ambiguous target, rewrites, or reorders Markdown; every readable item carries its current revision. maxChars covers final JSON formatting. Budget-compacted paths retain an exact authored prefix or an explicit same-query retry: apply nextAction.overrides to the original arguments when reuseOriginalArguments is true. Omitted diagnostics are not an empty or safe route; at the ceiling inspect the MOC with the returned notes.read action.",
